<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ZiGo | Payment Failed</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-orange: #FF5A1F;
            --primary-red: #FE4A49;
            --secondary: #1E293B;
            --bg-glass: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            --border-glass: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            --shadow-premium: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFF5F5 0%, #FED7D7 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .glass-card {
            background: var(--bg-glass);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-premium);
            border-radius: 2.5rem;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 600px;
            padding: 3.5rem 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            animation: cardScale 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
        }

        @keyframes cardScale {
            from { transform: scale(0.9); opacity: 0; }
            to { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
        }

        .fail-icon-container {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            margin: 0 auto 2rem;
            background: #FFE5E5;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: var(--primary-red);
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(254, 74, 73, 0.1);
            position: relative;
        }

        .fail-icon {
            animation: shake 0.5s cubic-bezier(.36,.07,.19,.97) both;
            transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
            backface-visibility: hidden;
            perspective: 1000px;
        }

        @keyframes shake {
            10%, 90% { transform: translate3d(-1px, 0, 0); }
            20%, 80% { transform: translate3d(2px, 0, 0); }
            30%, 50%, 70% { transform: translate3d(-4px, 0, 0); }
            40%, 60% { transform: translate3d(4px, 0, 0); }
        }

        .info-pill {
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid #F1F5F9;
            border-radius: 1.25rem;
            padding: 1.25rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            text-align: left;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .info-pill:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
            border-color: var(--primary-orange);
        }

        .btn-retry {
            background: var(--primary-orange);
            color: white;
            padding: 1.25rem;
            border-radius: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 0.75rem;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(255, 90, 31, 0.2);
        }

        .btn-retry:hover {
            background: #E44D18;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(255, 90, 31, 0.3);
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background: #F8FAFC;
            color: var(--secondary);
            padding: 1.25rem;
            border-radius: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 0.75rem;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            text-decoration: none;
            border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
        }

        .btn-secondary:hover {
            background: white;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .error-details {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #94A3B8;
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
            font-style: italic;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="glass-card">
        <div class="fail-icon-container">
            <i class="fas fa-times fail-icon"></i>
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-2">Payment Failed</h1>
        <p class="text-slate-500 mb-8 px-4">Don't worry! Your money is safe. There was an issue processing your payment, but you can try again below.</p>

        <div class="space-y-3 mb-10 px-2">
            <div class="info-pill flex justify-between items-center">
                <div>
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">Order #</span>
                    <span class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800"><%= order.orderNumber %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="text-right">
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">Amount Due</span>
                    <span class="text-lg font-black text-orange-500">₹<%= order.pricing.total.toLocaleString() %></span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="info-pill">
                <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">Payment Method Used</span>
                <span class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 uppercase italic">
                    <%= order.paymentMethod === 'rozorpay' ? 'razorpay' : order.paymentMethod %>
                </span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4">
            <a href="/user/order/<%= order._id %>" class="btn-retry">
                <i class="fas fa-redo-alt"></i> Retry Payment
            </a>
            <a href="/shop" class="btn-secondary">
                <i class="fas fa-shopping-bag"></i> Continue Shopping
            </a>
        </div>

        <p class="error-details">If the amount was deducted, it will be refunded within 3-5 business days.</p>
        
        <div class="mt-8 pt-8 border-t border-slate-100">
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium tracking-tight">Need help? <a href="/contact" class="text-primary-orange hover:underline">Contact Support</a></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>
